{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09177","headline":"送刘评事 · 韦应物","name":"送刘评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"声华满京洛，藻翰发阳春。\n未遂鵷鸿举，尚爲江海宾。\n吴中高宴罢，西上一游秦。\n已想函关道，游子冒风尘。\n笼禽羡归翼，远守怀交亲。\n况复岁云暮，凛凛冰霜辰。\n旭霁开郡阁，宠饯集文人。\n洞庭摘朱实，松江献白鳞。\n丈夫岂恨别，一酌且欢忻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}